      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DAKOTA MILA (1) ran a superb 22.75 when winning over 400m at Gawler last start. Should be in this for a long way. BROTHER BILO (2) slotted in just off the lead from the wide box before lifting strongly to score (19.18) at Murray Bridge Straight in a Grade 4/5 over 350m. Recorded the quickest time on the card last start. Has definite claims. JAZZY HOPE (7) was far too good after leading them home to make it back to back wins, scoring by 5 lengths (30.48) at this track over 530m. Safe beginner but wide box to overcome and will need some luck. In sparkling form and looks the one to beat again. RITZA WOTTON (8) form at this distance reads well.",
